# The production FAISS index (faiss_index/) IS committed - it's small
# (~1.2MB) and the Dockerfile/HF Space build needs it without having to
# run Ollama at build/deploy time. Only the ablation indices are ignored.
!/faiss_index/
!/faiss_index/*.faiss
!/faiss_index/*.pkl
